I think chuckcar was saying that you should change the msghistory before 
it gets to that. In tile-based NH such as Qt, you don't need ^p to 
access the message history, and you can view the messages after you die. 
This is necessary, because you don't get a --More-- prompt either; the 
messages just scroll up. If you die while helpless, as the OP did, you 
just get a whole bunch of messages at once.

The lack of --More-- was one of the chief reasons I could never deal 
with tile mode.


